{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4466b4e5741fb9b3","name":"Katarn-Class Commando Armor","source":{"id":"source:reference-4466b4e5741fb9b3","title":"Katarn-Class Commando Armor","revision":20888,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:43:19Z","sha256":"650e3fa87d650f122c691e7ac572d7689582d05ed8c4e416679d3296f95159fa","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20888","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Katarn-Class%20Commando%20Armor&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4466b4e5741fb9b3","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Issued several months after the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Geonosis"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Geonosis","referenceId":"reference:2f85e38b680a11c3"},", ",{"tag":"i","children":["Katarn"]},"-Class Commando Armor is a superior, specialized armor, designed with input from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Commandos"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Commandos"}," in the field. This highly sought after armor is rarely found in the possession of civilians; its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Black Market"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Black_Market"}," price can exceed a quarter-million credits. The armor is unusually thick, with a sealed system allowing the wearer to survive underwater or in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vacuum"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vacuum","referenceId":"reference:f93faa368bc7aefa"}," for up to 24 hours. It also features a built-in, retractable, wrist-mounted ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vibroblade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vibroblade","referenceId":"reference:4d5963781a5121d7"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Commando Armor grants a wearer with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor Proficiency (Heavy)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor_Proficiency_(Heavy)","referenceId":"reference:7773896a63cadb7f"}," feat a +2 bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks, as well as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low-Light Vision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Low-Light_Vision"},". The armor includes an integrated ",{"tag":"a","children":["Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlink","referenceId":"reference:609e72c37493843f"}," in the helmet, allowing hands-free communication. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", the wearer can use the Bacta tanks built into the armor. The Bacta and the suit's built-in diagnostic gear grant the wearer an effective ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," +10 bonus for self-treatment. The wearer ignores the -5 penalty for self-administration of this skill.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Katarn"]},"-Class Commando Armor is highly customizable. If you are using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor Upgrades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor_Upgrades"}," options from ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},", the Commando Armor has the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vacuum Seals"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vacuum_Seals","referenceId":"reference:9bbb89865d7ea455"}," upgrade as well as three additional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Slots"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Slots"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medium Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medium_Armor","referenceId":"reference:e2a45d7d144d40dd"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 30,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},":"]}," +9\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},":"]}," +4\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Maximum ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," Bonus:"]}," +1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 20 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
